-in-the-paddock/"}},{"topic":"news-f11cdaf92d6621bd-0","title":"迈凯伦与OKX推出特别涂装","text":"迈凯伦与OKX合作推出限定涂装，使用范围是意大利和西班牙两站。该设计庆祝双方自2022年起的合作。","tag":"新涂装","dimension":"visual","year":2026,"publishedAt":"2026-09-01T16:00:00.000Z","temporal":"event","status":"confirmed","related":{"drivers":["lando-norris","oscar-piastri"],"teams":["mclaren"],"seasons":[2026],"races":["2026/13","2026/14"]},"sources":[{"label":"车队官方","url":"https://www.mclaren.com/racing/formula-1/2026/italian-grand-prix/okx-livery/"}],"verifiedAt":"2026-10-14","photo":{"url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/championwang00/pitwall-f1/codex/editorial-news/images/dffcdcd883a701f78dd8535e.webp","width":960,"height":1200,"bytes":33734,"caption":"MCL40 OKX livery for the Italian Grand Prix 2026","source":"https://www.mclaren.com/racing/formula-1/2026/italian-grand-prix/okx-livery/"}},{"topic":"news-382c1c4386535041-0","title":"凯迪拉克主场特别涂装","text":"凯迪拉克在迈阿密迎来首个F1主场赛，推出星条旗特别涂装，前翼有50颗星代表美国各州，尾翼红白蓝拼出USA。博塔斯和佩雷兹将穿特别赛服。","tag":"新涂装","dimension":"visual","year":2026,"publishedAt":"2026-05-01T13:10:27.884Z","temporal":"event","status":"confirmed","related":{"drivers":["valtteri-bottas","sergio-perez"],"teams":["cadillac"],"seasons":[2026],"races":["2026/4"]},"sources":[{"label":"F1 官方","url":"https://www.formula1.com/en/latest/article/all-the-liveries-special-helmet-designs-and-eye-catching-looks-for-miami.7oF76lk9j3Og4NMq8G4duU"}],"verifiedAt":"2026-10-14","photo":{"url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/championwang00/pitwall-f1/codex/editorial-news/images/8fde2a3a61f810269286fbc2.webp","width":1200,"height":675,"bytes":154688,"caption":"官方报道配图","source":"https://www.formula1.com/en/latest/article/all-the-liveries-special-helmet-designs-and-eye-catching-looks-for-miami.7oF76lk9j3Og4NMq8G4duU"}},{"topic":"news-382c1c4386535041-1","title":"小红牛青柠黄涂装","text":"小红牛在迈阿密推出青柠黄特别涂装，灵感来自夏日版红牛Sudachi Lime。DJ Khaled助阵，滑水者飞跃赛车揭幕，劳森和林德布拉德在摩托艇上观看。","tag":"新涂装","dimension":"visual","year":2026,"publishedAt":"2026-05-01T13:10:27.884Z